WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.352
Where is the ball?

2
00:00:10.353 --> 00:00:14.317
Is it behind the curtain?

3
00:00:14.318 --> 00:00:17.907
No, it isn't.

4
00:00:17.908 --> 00:00:22.240
There's a backpack behind the curtain.

5
00:00:22.241 --> 00:00:26.430
Is it under the dresser?

6
00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:29.659
No, it isn't.

7
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:33.460
There's a wallet under the dresser.

8
00:00:33.461 --> 00:00:36.614
Is it in front of the cabinet?

9
00:00:36.615 --> 00:00:39.482
No, it isn't.

10
00:00:39.483 --> 00:00:43.790
There's a pen in front of the cabinet.

11
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.297
Is it on the couch?

12
00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:49.168
No, it isn't.

13
00:00:49.169 --> 00:00:53.107
There's an alarm clock on the couch.

14
00:00:53.108 --> 00:00:56.307
Is it beside the fireplace?

15
00:00:56.308 --> 00:00:59.764
No, it isn't.

16
00:00:59.765 --> 00:01:04.065
There's a broom beside the fireplace.

17
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:07.227
Is it between the flowerpots?

18
00:01:07.228 --> 00:01:10.581
No, it isn't.

19
00:01:10.582 --> 00:01:14.780
There's a glove between the flowerpots.

20
00:01:14.781 --> 00:01:18.817
Is it in the doghouse?

21
00:01:18.818 --> 00:01:21.756
Yes, it is.

22
00:01:21.757 --> 00:01:25.224
The ball is in the doghouse.

23
00:01:25.225 --> 00:01:41.898
I found the ball.

